1
00:00:41,959 --> 00:00:47,965
THE PERFECT LIE

2
00:00:53,053 --> 00:00:54,638
THIS DRAMA IS A WORK OF FICTION.

3
00:00:54,721 --> 00:00:57,975
SCENES INVOLVING CHILD ACTORS
AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY.

4
00:01:04,856 --> 00:01:11,863
3 MONTHS LATER

5
00:01:16,827 --> 00:01:22,958
EPISODE 8
LIAR

6
00:01:36,722 --> 00:01:39,975
Stop staring at me and eat your food.
What am I, a TV?

7
00:01:40,601 --> 00:01:45,522
I still can't believe someone so beautiful
is sitting right in front of me,

8
00:01:46,398 --> 00:01:48,358
let alone that she's my girlfriend.

9
00:01:50,277 --> 00:01:52,863
Don't ever get contacts or glasses,

10
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:54,531
or laser eye surgery.

11
00:01:54,614 --> 00:01:57,451
I want you to stay this blind
to my flaws forever.

12
00:01:58,035 --> 00:02:01,163
[Namu] These days,
I don't even get hungry when I skip meals

13
00:02:01,663 --> 00:02:04,082
or feel tired when I don't sleep.

14
00:02:16,720 --> 00:02:17,888
Thank you.

15
00:02:20,390 --> 00:02:21,516
Likewise.

16
00:02:49,795 --> 00:02:51,088
[Jisun] <i>What kind of flowers are these?</i>

17
00:02:51,755 --> 00:02:53,715
Oh, they're gladiolus.

18
00:02:54,591 --> 00:02:56,134
"Gladiolus"?

19
00:02:56,218 --> 00:02:57,219
Yes.

20
00:02:57,302 --> 00:02:58,762
They're beautiful.

21
00:03:00,764 --> 00:03:01,765
[Namu] Is that…

22
00:03:04,059 --> 00:03:05,394
Is that him?

23
00:03:07,396 --> 00:03:08,563
It doesn't matter.

24
00:03:16,488 --> 00:03:20,701
I can't believe they dropped the charges,
even with photos of him buying GHB.

25
00:03:28,417 --> 00:03:29,876
Min Junho!

26
00:03:35,924 --> 00:03:39,302
[Hwayoung] Min Junho, you're under arrest
for violating the Narcotics Control Act.

27
00:03:51,273 --> 00:03:52,691
What happened?

28
00:03:53,692 --> 00:03:57,070
We've secured evidence that Min Junho
purchased GHB and actually received it.

29
00:03:57,946 --> 00:03:59,448
He'll be prosecuted.

30
00:04:05,787 --> 00:04:07,372
He always finds a way out.

31
00:04:12,711 --> 00:04:14,171
No matter how hard we try.

32
00:04:17,090 --> 00:04:18,842
<i>-Min Junho always wins.</i>

33
00:04:19,384 --> 00:04:20,719
-[Hwayoung] If this…
-[captain sighs]

34
00:04:20,802 --> 00:04:24,264
If this isn't Min Junho, then who is it?

35
00:04:26,266 --> 00:04:31,062
[captain] So basically, they're telling us
we have to catch him in the act.

36
00:04:31,146 --> 00:04:32,564
[Hwayoung] Damn it.

37
00:04:37,110 --> 00:04:38,528
They're not prosecuting him?

38
00:04:44,409 --> 00:04:47,537
THE PROSECUTION HEREBY DECIDES
NOT TO PROSECUTE AS FOLLOWS

39
00:04:47,621 --> 00:04:48,622
[Hwayoung] We'll have to…

40
00:04:52,167 --> 00:04:53,710
find another way now.

41
00:05:01,092 --> 00:05:03,136
[Namu] <i>I can't imagine</i>
<i>how you must feel seeing him</i>

42
00:05:03,220 --> 00:05:04,846
walking around like nothing happened.

43
00:05:07,265 --> 00:05:08,391
Don't worry about it.

44
00:05:09,726 --> 00:05:12,562
I don't want someone like him
ruining our date.

45
00:05:14,773 --> 00:05:15,857
Let's get out of here.

46
00:05:16,983 --> 00:05:19,152
-I'm fine.
-Well, I'm not.

47
00:05:23,615 --> 00:05:24,616
Come on, let's go.

48
00:05:48,807 --> 00:05:50,350
[date] How about a glass of wine tonight?

49
00:05:51,685 --> 00:05:52,686
Maybe next time.

50
00:05:54,396 --> 00:05:58,441
I don't like letting alcohol
make me act on impulse.

51
00:05:59,693 --> 00:06:02,028
See, that's what I like about you.

52
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,408
Take your pick.

53
00:06:23,383 --> 00:06:27,220
Promise you'll call me
if anything happens.

54
00:06:38,273 --> 00:06:39,482
I'm…

55
00:06:40,817 --> 00:06:44,237
not very good at relationships
and I'm not much fun, am I?

56
00:06:51,536 --> 00:06:53,163
Do you know why I like you, Namu?

57
00:06:59,753 --> 00:07:01,588
Because I know what to expect from you.

58
00:07:05,675 --> 00:07:07,636
You're the same person
through and through.

59
00:07:10,347 --> 00:07:13,350
I can tell by the way you treat people.

60
00:07:14,851 --> 00:07:15,894
You're always generous,

61
00:07:15,977 --> 00:07:18,063
but you have principles
you never compromise on.

62
00:07:21,858 --> 00:07:26,196
Even if the passion between us
fades someday…

63
00:07:28,990 --> 00:07:32,202
I think you'll still treat me
with the same kindness.

64
00:07:38,583 --> 00:07:42,545
[Namu] You're so full of color, Jisun.

65
00:07:44,839 --> 00:07:46,257
You're like…

66
00:07:46,341 --> 00:07:51,763
red and green and yellow and purple…

67
00:08:30,009 --> 00:08:31,553
[Jisun] Have a good trip.

68
00:09:32,197 --> 00:09:33,323
RECENT SEARCHES
MIN JUNHO

69
00:09:33,406 --> 00:09:36,034
MIN JUNHO
CARDIOVASCULAR AND THORACIC SURGEON

70
00:09:45,418 --> 00:09:46,795
TAGGED IN THIS PHOTO

71
00:09:49,380 --> 00:09:52,467
YUMYUM PILATES STUDIO
SHIN YUMI

72
00:10:14,781 --> 00:10:17,951
Honestly, I don't even know
why I agreed to meet you.

73
00:10:19,536 --> 00:10:21,871
He's already told me about you.

74
00:10:27,168 --> 00:10:28,419
What did he say?

75
00:10:28,503 --> 00:10:30,380
[Yumi] That you put him through a lot.

76
00:10:35,969 --> 00:10:40,265
Anyone hearing that would think
I was stalking Min Junho.

77
00:10:41,141 --> 00:10:42,892
[Yumi] He warned me to be careful too.

78
00:10:44,060 --> 00:10:46,187
He said he can't trust women
so easily anymore.

79
00:10:47,147 --> 00:10:49,149
And he's a sex offender.

80
00:10:50,859 --> 00:10:52,068
Ms. Shin Yumi,

81
00:10:52,902 --> 00:10:54,612
do you really trust him?

82
00:10:57,699 --> 00:10:59,450
Well, why should I believe you?

83
00:10:59,534 --> 00:11:01,911
There are two other victims besides me.

84
00:11:02,495 --> 00:11:05,498
I just want you to think carefully
about who's telling the truth.

85
00:11:05,582 --> 00:11:07,417
The three of us or him?

86
00:11:10,920 --> 00:11:13,590
He may seem like
someone you can trust now,

87
00:11:14,841 --> 00:11:17,969
but you never know when he'll drop the act
and show his true colors.

88
00:11:18,052 --> 00:11:19,721
You don't need to worry about me.

89
00:11:20,847 --> 00:11:22,765
If anything happens, you can call me--

90
00:11:22,849 --> 00:11:24,893
[groans] I see what he meant when he said…

91
00:11:27,061 --> 00:11:28,229
you were obsessive.

92
00:12:01,888 --> 00:12:04,766
INCOMING CALL

93
00:12:15,652 --> 00:12:16,778
Hello?

94
00:12:17,362 --> 00:12:20,615
[Junho] <i>Isn't it a little early for bed?</i>

95
00:12:21,658 --> 00:12:23,034
-What is this?

96
00:12:24,619 --> 00:12:26,329
[Junho] <i>When you're lying in bed at night,</i>

97
00:12:27,580 --> 00:12:29,249
<i>do you ever think about me?</i>

98
00:12:50,853 --> 00:12:52,981
<i>-</i>[Jisun] <i>Get lost.</i>
-I heard you met with Yumi.

99
00:12:54,732 --> 00:12:57,277
How long are you going
to keep following me around?

100
00:12:58,736 --> 00:13:00,905
I'm never giving up until you're caught.

101
00:13:02,949 --> 00:13:04,409
Well, that's just sad.

102
00:13:04,492 --> 00:13:05,535
Just you wait.

103
00:13:06,744 --> 00:13:10,206
Someday, all the pain you've caused others
will come right back to you.

104
00:13:10,290 --> 00:13:11,582
[Junho] <i>Remember that night?</i>

105
00:13:18,506 --> 00:13:19,590
I enjoyed it.

106
00:13:23,303 --> 00:13:24,512
See you again soon.

107
00:13:51,581 --> 00:13:53,916
Min Junho called me
from outside my house last night.

108
00:13:55,001 --> 00:13:56,085
What for?

109
00:13:56,711 --> 00:13:59,005
I think he just came
to scare me over the phone.

110
00:14:00,590 --> 00:14:03,384
I didn't get a wink of sleep,
so he got exactly what he wanted.

111
00:14:03,468 --> 00:14:04,719
Out of the blue?

112
00:14:05,678 --> 00:14:08,973
Well, no. I saw him on a date
with another woman,

113
00:14:09,474 --> 00:14:11,684
so I met with her and told her about him.

114
00:14:11,768 --> 00:14:13,478
-Ms. Kang!
-We have to stop anyone else

115
00:14:13,561 --> 00:14:15,104
-from becoming a victim.
-We will.

116
00:14:16,022 --> 00:14:18,024
So stay away from Min Junho from now on.

117
00:14:18,983 --> 00:14:21,235
The police are already
keeping an eye on him.

118
00:14:34,999 --> 00:14:36,250
[Jisun] I think…

119
00:14:38,586 --> 00:14:40,088
he recorded what he did to me.

120
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:46,135
What makes you think that?

121
00:14:48,513 --> 00:14:50,723
He brought up
what happened that night, and…

122
00:14:53,351 --> 00:14:57,396
he remembered even the smallest details
about my bed and bedroom.

123
00:14:59,273 --> 00:15:00,608
[Junho] <i>Remember that night?</i>

124
00:15:02,902 --> 00:15:04,821
<i>Your mint-green comforter…</i>

125
00:15:06,364 --> 00:15:08,741
and those frilly bedsheets.

126
00:15:11,744 --> 00:15:12,745
I enjoyed it.

127
00:15:15,498 --> 00:15:18,251
Min Junho is sharp and highly observant.

128
00:15:18,334 --> 00:15:20,086
No, the way he spoke, it was clear.

129
00:15:22,964 --> 00:15:26,551
He talked about that night
as if he were watching it happen.

130
00:15:31,931 --> 00:15:34,934
Men like him want to control women
and humiliate them.

131
00:15:35,560 --> 00:15:37,728
What could be more humiliating
than being filmed?

132
00:15:40,231 --> 00:15:42,525
We've searched his house,
the hospital, and his car.

133
00:15:42,608 --> 00:15:45,027
Every one of his devices.
We didn't miss a single one.

134
00:15:45,111 --> 00:15:46,904
-I know, but--
-[Hwayoung] Ms. Kang.

135
00:15:49,031 --> 00:15:50,116
Please…

136
00:15:53,035 --> 00:15:54,328
-Don't do anything.

137
00:16:03,421 --> 00:16:05,339
I'm asking you this
not as a police officer,

138
00:16:07,008 --> 00:16:09,093
but as a fellow victim.

139
00:16:17,268 --> 00:16:19,562
I'll have a patrol car
stationed outside your house.

140
00:16:20,688 --> 00:16:25,484
Please look out for Shin Yumi too.
The woman that's dating him right now.

141
00:16:29,947 --> 00:16:31,073
I will.

142
00:17:10,071 --> 00:17:11,364
[Yumi] Hello.

143
00:17:11,447 --> 00:17:13,241
[Hwayoung] Sorry to drop by unannounced.

144
00:17:13,324 --> 00:17:14,408
Not at all.

145
00:17:14,492 --> 00:17:16,744
As you can see,
I was in the middle of training.

146
00:17:16,827 --> 00:17:21,415
Actually, I just spoke
with Ms. Kang Jisun, and--

147
00:17:21,499 --> 00:17:22,917
Ms. Kang Jisun?

148
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:24,502
I met her yesterday too.

149
00:17:28,214 --> 00:17:29,674
She thinks Min Junho

150
00:17:30,841 --> 00:17:32,843
may have recorded his crimes.

151
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:39,517
And that he's keeping
the recordings somewhere.

152
00:17:43,771 --> 00:17:45,022
And…

153
00:17:45,731 --> 00:17:47,441
she's worried about you, Inspector.

154
00:17:50,611 --> 00:17:51,779
I see.

155
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:54,615
She seemed like a good person.

156
00:17:57,201 --> 00:18:00,162
Min Junho showed up outside
Ms. Kang's house last night.

157
00:18:00,997 --> 00:18:03,666
I think it's because
she's been digging into his affairs.

158
00:18:05,459 --> 00:18:06,502
I know.

159
00:18:11,716 --> 00:18:13,926
Did you tell him about her?

160
00:18:18,264 --> 00:18:19,307
Why would you do that?

161
00:18:20,308 --> 00:18:22,143
I want him on edge.

162
00:18:23,978 --> 00:18:27,523
That's when he'll make mistakes,
and that's how we'll catch him.

163
00:18:29,233 --> 00:18:32,111
I don't want Ms. Kang
getting caught up in this.

164
00:18:32,194 --> 00:18:34,572
She chose to get involved.

165
00:18:35,573 --> 00:18:38,618
I just used that opportunity
to play on Min Junho's anxiety.

166
00:18:38,701 --> 00:18:40,411
Why are you provoking him like that?

167
00:18:41,787 --> 00:18:44,040
Because he won't leave Kang Jisun alone.

168
00:18:45,916 --> 00:18:48,169
What do you think Min Junho is after?

169
00:18:55,217 --> 00:18:56,552
Whatever it is,

170
00:18:58,054 --> 00:18:59,847
I'll catch him before he gets the chance.

171
00:19:03,934 --> 00:19:07,688
Min Junho is not an ordinary sex offender.

172
00:19:07,772 --> 00:19:08,773
I know.

173
00:19:09,273 --> 00:19:10,900
He's a malignant narcissist.

174
00:19:18,449 --> 00:19:21,285
<i>How about dinner at my place on Sunday?</i>

175
00:19:22,036 --> 00:19:24,163
For now, leave Min Junho to me.

176
00:19:29,627 --> 00:19:30,920
[Hwayoung] And one more thing…

177
00:19:32,713 --> 00:19:34,548
This is a GHB test kit.

178
00:19:35,299 --> 00:19:36,801
Keep it with you at all times.

179
00:19:38,386 --> 00:19:39,845
Collecting evidence is one thing,

180
00:19:39,929 --> 00:19:41,639
but you need to stay safe too.

181
00:19:43,099 --> 00:19:44,475
Thank you.

182
00:20:03,369 --> 00:20:06,706
19:07 DEPARTED SANGCHEON HOSPITAL
20:10 ARRIVED HOME

183
00:20:28,602 --> 00:20:29,687
Honey?

184
00:20:48,414 --> 00:20:51,542
[automated voice] <i>The call cannot</i>
<i>be connected. Please leave a message…</i>

185
00:21:26,577 --> 00:21:27,661
[Seokgu] Don't touch that.

186
00:21:29,330 --> 00:21:30,581
You were home?

187
00:21:31,165 --> 00:21:32,541
[Seokgu] Hey, this…

188
00:21:32,625 --> 00:21:34,710
It's sharper than it looks.

189
00:21:34,794 --> 00:21:36,754
-[blade snaps shut]
-I don't want you getting hurt.

190
00:21:40,591 --> 00:21:42,593
-[Hwayoung] Should we…
-[Seokgu] Yeah?

191
00:21:43,636 --> 00:21:45,387
…order something nice for dinner tonight?

192
00:21:48,724 --> 00:21:51,185
Sorry, I have something I need to finish.

193
00:21:51,894 --> 00:21:53,187
Go ahead and order something.

194
00:21:53,854 --> 00:21:57,858
Chubchubs, keep Mommy company
for dinner tonight, okay?

195
00:21:59,193 --> 00:22:00,486
See you in a bit.

196
00:22:07,284 --> 00:22:09,370
-[drill whirring]

197
00:22:15,125 --> 00:22:17,002
[person] Enjoying your leave?

198
00:22:17,086 --> 00:22:18,087
[Seokgu] Yeah.

199
00:22:23,342 --> 00:22:26,053
[person] I thought
you were planning to run away

200
00:22:26,136 --> 00:22:27,888
when you said you wanted an old yacht.

201
00:22:28,931 --> 00:22:32,268
But now it looks like you're heading
out to sea to dump a body or something.

202
00:22:38,357 --> 00:22:40,359
Come by my office.
Let's have a glass of soju.

203
00:22:41,986 --> 00:22:42,987
[Seokgu] Hey, Muyeong.

204
00:22:44,405 --> 00:22:46,657
Can you pretend
you don't know anything about this?

205
00:22:51,245 --> 00:22:52,413
Hey, what's going on?

206
00:22:53,414 --> 00:22:56,166
From this moment on, you don't know me.
Got it?

207
00:23:44,214 --> 00:23:48,552
-[nurse] Huh? Who put soju in my drink?
-[staff 1] It was me.

208
00:23:50,763 --> 00:23:51,972
[staff 2] How about a toast?

209
00:23:52,056 --> 00:23:54,516
-[staff 3] Sounds good.
-[staff 2] Cheers!

210
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:57,269
-Good work, team!
-Good work, everyone!

211
00:24:01,315 --> 00:24:03,192
-[staff 4] Oh, man. I'm stuffed.
-[head nurse] Dr. Min!

212
00:24:03,984 --> 00:24:05,861
Let's go for round two!

213
00:24:05,945 --> 00:24:07,363
[Junho] I've had quite a bit to drink.

214
00:24:07,446 --> 00:24:08,906
-How about <i>gopchang</i>?
-Oh, no…

215
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:10,783
[staff 4] Let's go! No skipping out!

216
00:24:10,866 --> 00:24:12,826
Come on! Let's go!

217
00:24:12,910 --> 00:24:15,329
-Let's go, hurry up!
-Okay, let's go!

218
00:24:15,913 --> 00:24:17,915
[staff] Cheers!

219
00:24:21,168 --> 00:24:22,461
Thank you.

220
00:24:24,755 --> 00:24:26,215
Cheers.

221
00:24:45,442 --> 00:24:46,944
[Muyeong] What's this?

222
00:24:47,945 --> 00:24:49,363
You said you had a work dinner.

223
00:24:50,906 --> 00:24:53,033
Where were you last night?
I couldn't reach you.

224
00:24:54,702 --> 00:24:56,161
I asked you where you were!

225
00:24:56,787 --> 00:24:58,664
DR. MIN JUNHO

226
00:24:58,747 --> 00:25:00,874
<i>Did you get home okay this morning?</i>

227
00:25:05,587 --> 00:25:06,588
Wait, I…

228
00:25:08,215 --> 00:25:09,758
I don't remember.

229
00:25:28,527 --> 00:25:30,654
SAFETY, INTEGRITY, TRUST
MANAGEMENT OFFICE

230
00:25:44,877 --> 00:25:47,129
[nurse] You promised
you'd come home today.

231
00:25:47,212 --> 00:25:48,297
Today's our wedding anniversary--

232
00:25:48,380 --> 00:25:49,840
[Muyeong] You're the one who said that.

233
00:26:12,529 --> 00:26:14,573
[nurse] How did he get out of it?

234
00:26:18,077 --> 00:26:22,706
I think that woman Kang Jisun
and I went through the same thing.

235
00:26:23,874 --> 00:26:25,167
You called her a gold digger.

236
00:26:27,002 --> 00:26:28,212
What, so…

237
00:26:29,129 --> 00:26:31,090
have you come up with a different excuse?

238
00:26:36,386 --> 00:26:39,098
When you talk to me like that,
it really makes me want to die.

239
00:26:39,890 --> 00:26:41,308
I said I can't remember--

240
00:26:41,391 --> 00:26:43,560
Will you please stop lying?

241
00:26:46,814 --> 00:26:50,359
Just admit you got drunk with that doctor
you had a thing for and made a mistake.

242
00:26:50,442 --> 00:26:53,278
At least be honest about it
and beg me to forgive you.

243
00:26:56,907 --> 00:26:59,159
The fact that you're still
lying to me like this…

244
00:27:01,495 --> 00:27:03,330
It makes me feel even more miserable.

245
00:27:26,436 --> 00:27:30,649
CARDIOVASCULAR CENTER

246
00:27:46,039 --> 00:27:47,040
[Junho] Yes.

247
00:27:50,627 --> 00:27:52,546
Make sure everything goes
according to plan.

248
00:28:09,688 --> 00:28:11,899
-[Jisun struggling]

249
00:28:12,774 --> 00:28:15,777
Hey. Keep it down, will you?

250
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:08,372
[kidnapper 1] What the…

251
00:29:08,455 --> 00:29:10,499
-Damn it!
-[Jisun] No!

252
00:29:13,043 --> 00:29:15,045
-[Jisun screams]
-[kidnapper 1] You didn't lock the door?

253
00:29:23,303 --> 00:29:25,097
[kidnapper 1] What are you doing?
Knock her out.

254
00:29:27,140 --> 00:29:28,600
-[kidnapper 1] Jeez.
-[kidnapper 2] Damn it.

255
00:29:44,658 --> 00:29:46,576
EDEN PSYCHIATRIC HOSPITAL

256
00:29:49,579 --> 00:29:51,206
[kidnapper 1] Hey, wake up!

257
00:29:51,873 --> 00:29:53,417
She's completely knocked out, huh?

258
00:29:59,047 --> 00:30:00,424
[doctor] Ms. Kang Jisun?

259
00:30:00,507 --> 00:30:01,758
Is all the paperwork ready?

260
00:30:01,842 --> 00:30:03,760
-[kidnapper 1] Oh, of course. Here it is.
-[doctor] Okay.

261
00:30:08,598 --> 00:30:10,600
[doctor] Take her
to the high-observation room.

262
00:30:10,684 --> 00:30:12,060
-[kidnapper 1] Okay.
-[doctor] Go ahead.

263
00:30:24,072 --> 00:30:26,283
-[kidnapper 1] What the…
-[kidnapper 2] What the hell?

264
00:30:26,366 --> 00:30:27,451
[kidnapper 1] What's wrong with this?

265
00:30:27,534 --> 00:30:28,994
What's going on with this thing?

266
00:30:31,663 --> 00:30:32,706
[kidnapper 1] It's not working?

267
00:30:32,789 --> 00:30:34,249
[kidnapper 2] Damn it,
the doors won't close.

268
00:30:34,332 --> 00:30:36,543
-[kidnapper 1] What's wrong?
-[kidnapper 2] Hello?

269
00:30:38,253 --> 00:30:39,254
It's not working.

270
00:30:39,337 --> 00:30:40,797
[kidnapper 1] Jeez,
what's wrong with this?

271
00:30:41,298 --> 00:30:42,924
-Hello?
-[kidnapper 1] What the…

272
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:45,927
-[kidnapper 1 screams]
-[kidnapper 2] Hey, what's wrong?

273
00:30:46,011 --> 00:30:47,345
-[Jisun screams]

274
00:30:47,429 --> 00:30:48,638
-[kidnapper 2] Damn it!
-[Jisun screams]

275
00:31:01,485 --> 00:31:03,028
[kidnapper 1 groans] Damn it!

276
00:31:05,572 --> 00:31:06,990
-[kidnapper 1 screaming]
-[Jisun] Let go!

277
00:31:12,871 --> 00:31:14,873
MEDICAL SCHOOL
FACULTY ASSOCIATION

278
00:31:14,956 --> 00:31:16,958
MAY YOUR VISION
REACH FAR AND WIDE

279
00:31:23,507 --> 00:31:24,758
FROM ALL THE STAFF

280
00:31:31,681 --> 00:31:35,227
CENTER DIRECTOR MIN JUNHO

281
00:31:52,786 --> 00:31:53,995
[Junho] Yes?

282
00:31:58,875 --> 00:32:00,210
She couldn't have gotten far.

283
00:32:02,504 --> 00:32:07,050
You do realize you'll be held responsible
if anything goes wrong, don't you?

284
00:32:10,303 --> 00:32:12,097
If you don't want to regret this later,

285
00:32:12,597 --> 00:32:17,435
do whatever it takes to find her,
and make sure she's locked away for good.

286
00:32:23,775 --> 00:32:25,443
-[door lock beeps]
-[Jisun] Park Junghyeon.

287
00:32:28,864 --> 00:32:30,615
-Hey.
-[exclaims]

288
00:32:33,952 --> 00:32:36,288
Hey, what… What are you doing here?

289
00:32:38,623 --> 00:32:39,749
Are you okay?

290
00:32:41,751 --> 00:32:42,836
[announcement over PA] <i>Code blue.</i>

291
00:32:42,919 --> 00:32:45,005
<i>Emergency Department,</i>
<i>traffic accident patient.</i>

292
00:33:11,823 --> 00:33:14,242
Do you think
I need to be institutionalized?

293
00:33:17,078 --> 00:33:18,079
No.

294
00:33:20,874 --> 00:33:22,334
Can I really trust you?

295
00:33:45,607 --> 00:33:46,775
Damn it.

296
00:34:14,010 --> 00:34:15,303
Why won't it turn off?

297
00:34:47,711 --> 00:34:51,965
[agent]<i> The last known location where</i>
<i>Mr. Min Junho's lost phone was turned on</i>

298
00:34:52,757 --> 00:34:56,094
<i>matches the location</i>
<i>of the phone you're calling from.</i>

299
00:34:57,679 --> 00:34:58,680
Here?

300
00:35:01,850 --> 00:35:03,101
Okay.

301
00:35:06,229 --> 00:35:07,939
-Thanks.
-[doctor] No problem.

302
00:35:10,609 --> 00:35:12,611
-[sighs]
-[door opens, closes]

303
00:35:17,991 --> 00:35:18,992
Thanks.

304
00:35:21,286 --> 00:35:23,288
No, thanks for letting me help.

305
00:35:26,458 --> 00:35:27,667
I should get going.

306
00:35:27,751 --> 00:35:29,169
[Junghyeon] I'm getting out of here.

307
00:35:31,588 --> 00:35:34,215
My cousin started a start-up,
and apparently it's taken off.

308
00:35:34,299 --> 00:35:36,384
I'm thinking of joining him
to learn the ropes.

309
00:35:46,728 --> 00:35:48,480
So you're the one leaving, not me.

310
00:35:51,232 --> 00:35:52,734
Well, I only have myself to blame.

311
00:35:54,402 --> 00:35:55,862
But what are you going to do with that?

312
00:35:58,948 --> 00:36:01,409
Whatever you're planning,
let me help you one more time.

313
00:36:06,414 --> 00:36:07,832
I think he might have…

314
00:36:12,045 --> 00:36:13,713
filmed what he did to me that night.

315
00:36:43,910 --> 00:36:45,328
[Junho] You're on time.

316
00:36:47,247 --> 00:36:48,248
Hey.

317
00:36:49,749 --> 00:36:50,834
Here.

318
00:36:50,917 --> 00:36:52,127
What's this?

319
00:36:52,210 --> 00:36:54,003
I didn't want to come empty-handed.

320
00:36:55,004 --> 00:36:57,340
Blue roses symbolize miracles.

321
00:36:59,426 --> 00:37:01,469
I just thought they suited you.

322
00:37:02,595 --> 00:37:06,141
So tonight, how about we have
a nice dinner and some wine?

323
00:37:07,892 --> 00:37:10,437
Is there some special occasion
I don't know about?

324
00:37:12,522 --> 00:37:15,191
Stay in the living room.
I'll get you a glass of wine.

325
00:37:44,012 --> 00:37:45,263
I love this painting.

326
00:37:46,890 --> 00:37:48,808
It's an original.
The only one in the world.

327
00:37:50,435 --> 00:37:51,853
Who's the artist?

328
00:37:52,854 --> 00:37:54,314
My mother.

329
00:37:55,565 --> 00:37:59,736
[Yumi] Wow, I don't know the first thing
about art, but it's beautiful.

330
00:38:02,447 --> 00:38:03,615
Cheers.

331
00:38:18,546 --> 00:38:19,631
Wait.

332
00:38:21,716 --> 00:38:23,009
I was thirsty on my way here,

333
00:38:23,092 --> 00:38:25,220
so I think this wine
will go straight to my head.

334
00:38:27,013 --> 00:38:28,264
Can I have a glass of water?

335
00:38:31,267 --> 00:38:32,727
Sure, I'll get you one.

336
00:39:03,800 --> 00:39:05,093
[Junho] Are you okay?

337
00:39:05,176 --> 00:39:06,636
-Thanks.
-[Junho] Yeah.

338
00:39:13,726 --> 00:39:14,978
-Hang on.
-Yeah.

339
00:39:16,104 --> 00:39:17,355
[Yumi] <i>Hey, Mom. What's up?</i>

340
00:39:18,982 --> 00:39:19,983
<i>What?</i>

341
00:39:21,818 --> 00:39:23,236
<i>Okay, I'll be right there.</i>

342
00:39:27,866 --> 00:39:28,908
Is something wrong?

343
00:39:28,992 --> 00:39:31,244
My mom's dog went missing.

344
00:39:32,453 --> 00:39:33,621
I have to go.

345
00:39:34,998 --> 00:39:35,999
Oh, yeah.

346
00:39:36,082 --> 00:39:37,250
You'd better hurry.

347
00:39:37,959 --> 00:39:38,960
I'm sorry, Junho.

348
00:39:40,128 --> 00:39:41,379
No, it's okay.

349
00:40:00,607 --> 00:40:01,691
Yes!

350
00:40:05,695 --> 00:40:06,863
[Junho] <i>If that had happened,</i>

351
00:40:08,114 --> 00:40:09,365
<i>you would've succeeded.</i>

352
00:40:34,223 --> 00:40:35,516
[Junho] Are you okay?

353
00:40:35,600 --> 00:40:37,185
-Thanks.
-[Junho] Yeah.

354
00:40:40,688 --> 00:40:42,565
Nice purse.

355
00:40:45,151 --> 00:40:46,653
-Mind if I take a look?
-[phone buzzing]

356
00:40:48,363 --> 00:40:49,530
Hang on.

357
00:40:54,786 --> 00:40:56,454
I guess it was a wrong number.

358
00:40:58,122 --> 00:40:59,374
I saw everything.

359
00:41:03,670 --> 00:41:05,505
-What are you talking about--
-So now…

360
00:41:07,173 --> 00:41:09,676
you'll make up some excuse
about having to leave, right?

361
00:41:11,761 --> 00:41:14,013
Maybe you'll get
another urgent phone call.

362
00:41:15,974 --> 00:41:21,062
Then you'll take that sample
and have it tested.

363
00:41:24,190 --> 00:41:26,275
And the police waiting outside
might even be

364
00:41:26,943 --> 00:41:29,278
-listening to this conversation right now.
-Damn it.

365
00:41:38,121 --> 00:41:40,873
Did I get that about right, Ms. Shin Yumi?

366
00:42:25,835 --> 00:42:27,086
[detective] The captain's here.

367
00:42:43,895 --> 00:42:45,146
[Jisun] <i>I think he might have…</i>

368
00:42:47,273 --> 00:42:48,900
filmed what he did to me that night.

369
00:42:51,819 --> 00:42:53,654
Should I just kill that bastard?

370
00:42:55,073 --> 00:42:57,742
I thought maybe
I could find something on it.

371
00:42:58,326 --> 00:43:00,161
Hey, wait. What are you doing?

372
00:43:00,244 --> 00:43:02,246
If you turn it on, they can track it.

373
00:43:03,081 --> 00:43:05,917
It's probably locked, and I'm sure
he's already reported it lost.

374
00:43:07,001 --> 00:43:09,045
I'll have an expert take a look at it.

375
00:43:11,214 --> 00:43:12,548
An expert? Who?

376
00:43:13,424 --> 00:43:14,759
[Junghyeon] Well, you don't need to know.

377
00:43:25,144 --> 00:43:26,521
Here, have some while you work.

378
00:43:26,604 --> 00:43:27,605
I unlocked it.

379
00:43:28,439 --> 00:43:29,440
You did?

380
00:43:30,316 --> 00:43:31,400
Damn…

381
00:43:37,406 --> 00:43:38,407
Hello?

382
00:43:40,243 --> 00:43:42,703
-A caregiver?
-[Junghyeon] <i>Yeah. </i>[inhales sharply]

383
00:43:42,787 --> 00:43:46,040
<i>This might be nothing,</i>
<i>but there are some text messages here.</i>

384
00:43:46,624 --> 00:43:48,626
I'll take a picture and send it to you.
Hang on.

385
00:43:57,552 --> 00:44:00,263
[caregiver] <i>When are you coming</i>
<i>to drop off the materials for safekeeping?</i>

386
00:44:01,889 --> 00:44:03,141
Where is he supposed to go?

387
00:44:03,641 --> 00:44:06,269
[Junghyeon] <i>These messages are from</i>
<i>a few days before he was arrested.</i>

388
00:44:06,352 --> 00:44:07,353
Wait.

389
00:44:08,271 --> 00:44:09,689
His mother's still alive.

390
00:44:10,481 --> 00:44:11,983
This could be her caregiver.

391
00:44:12,692 --> 00:44:14,193
Oh, really? Hang on.

392
00:44:14,277 --> 00:44:17,697
Let me check the app
and see if there's an address.

393
00:44:18,781 --> 00:44:21,367
Yeah, there's an address.
I'll send it to you.

394
00:44:21,450 --> 00:44:22,994
MOTHER'S HOUSE
7 GAOK-RO, SANGCHEON

395
00:44:28,624 --> 00:44:29,625
Got it.

396
00:44:30,918 --> 00:44:31,919
What about this phone?

397
00:44:33,212 --> 00:44:34,297
Just throw it away.

398
00:44:34,380 --> 00:44:36,465
I'll get rid of
your prepaid phone later too.

399
00:44:37,800 --> 00:44:39,302
<i>Thanks for your car too.</i>

400
00:44:39,886 --> 00:44:41,137
Sure. Be careful.

401
00:44:52,481 --> 00:44:53,524
Yeah, what is it now?

402
00:44:53,608 --> 00:44:56,569
Send that caregiver a text
from Min Junho's phone.

403
00:44:56,652 --> 00:44:59,197
Tell her his assistant
is coming to pick up the materials.

404
00:45:36,525 --> 00:45:38,110
[caregiver] <i>Who is it?</i>

405
00:45:38,194 --> 00:45:39,195
[Jisun] Oh, hi.

406
00:45:39,278 --> 00:45:43,366
I'm Dr. Min Junho's assistant.

407
00:45:52,333 --> 00:45:53,542
-Thank you.
-[caregiver chuckles softly]

408
00:45:56,420 --> 00:45:58,005
You should stay for dinner.

409
00:45:59,298 --> 00:46:01,926
No, I really have to get going.

410
00:46:02,009 --> 00:46:04,762
But we've never had
a friend of Dr. Min's visit before,

411
00:46:04,845 --> 00:46:06,722
so our chef
is already preparing something.

412
00:46:06,806 --> 00:46:09,100
He's excited to be
making something different

413
00:46:09,183 --> 00:46:11,352
than the special meals for his mother.

414
00:46:13,479 --> 00:46:15,481
Where is his mother?

415
00:46:16,065 --> 00:46:19,902
She doesn't like
strangers seeing her in her condition.

416
00:46:20,695 --> 00:46:24,699
But she was so happy when she heard
Dr. Min's girlfriend was coming today.

417
00:46:25,283 --> 00:46:26,450
Girlfriend?

418
00:46:27,368 --> 00:46:29,161
No, I'm not his girlfriend.

419
00:46:29,245 --> 00:46:31,664
I'm his research assistant.
I help him with his papers.

420
00:46:32,540 --> 00:46:36,127
[caregiver] Dr. Min sent a message asking
us to take especially good care of you.

421
00:46:36,711 --> 00:46:39,964
[Junghyeon] <i>My dear girlfriend will</i>
<i>be coming to pick up some materials.</i>

422
00:46:40,047 --> 00:46:42,550
<i>Please take good care of her.</i>

423
00:46:45,219 --> 00:46:47,054
[caregiver] Did you meet at the hospital?

424
00:46:48,222 --> 00:46:49,682
Oh, Dr. Min…

425
00:46:51,309 --> 00:46:56,731
By the way, where are
the materials Dr. Min keeps here?

426
00:46:58,691 --> 00:47:01,861
Oh, didn't he tell you?

427
00:47:04,989 --> 00:47:08,075
No, he had to rush off for surgery, so…

428
00:47:11,912 --> 00:47:13,831
[chuckles awkwardly] Just a moment.

429
00:47:35,227 --> 00:47:36,687
Could I use the bathroom?

430
00:48:30,908 --> 00:48:31,909
Oh, my gosh!

431
00:48:38,416 --> 00:48:39,583
Hello.

432
00:48:45,172 --> 00:48:46,632
Oh, there you are.

433
00:48:47,174 --> 00:48:49,510
The food's almost ready.

434
00:48:51,137 --> 00:48:53,139
Did you find the materials?

435
00:48:54,056 --> 00:48:56,058
Oh, well…

436
00:49:00,438 --> 00:49:02,815
Oh, ma'am, there you are.

437
00:49:04,692 --> 00:49:05,734
What's wrong?

438
00:49:06,527 --> 00:49:08,612
-Oh, my goodness.
-[Jisun] Are you okay?

439
00:49:08,696 --> 00:49:11,532
-[caregiver] Oh, my back. Butler!
-[Mother breathing heavily]

440
00:49:11,615 --> 00:49:14,285
[caregiver] Gosh, what do we do? Butler!

441
00:49:15,369 --> 00:49:17,455
-We need to help her up.

442
00:49:18,330 --> 00:49:19,623
-Oh, dear.
-[butler] Oh, my goodness!

443
00:49:19,707 --> 00:49:21,750
-What on earth happened?
-[caregiver grunts]

444
00:49:21,834 --> 00:49:22,835
[butler] Oh, dear.

445
00:49:23,544 --> 00:49:25,880
[caregiver] Oh, dear.

446
00:49:25,963 --> 00:49:27,923
Is she okay? Gosh.

447
00:50:13,302 --> 00:50:14,386
[Junho] Sorry I'm late.

448
00:50:14,470 --> 00:50:15,930
This is our new center director.

449
00:50:16,013 --> 00:50:17,681
And this is Chairman Kim.

450
00:50:17,765 --> 00:50:19,850
[Junho] Oh, I've heard so much about you.

451
00:50:19,934 --> 00:50:21,227
-Congratulations.
-Thank you.

452
00:50:21,310 --> 00:50:22,311
[Chairman Kim] Congratulations.

453
00:50:22,394 --> 00:50:23,729
GRAND OPENING

454
00:50:23,812 --> 00:50:25,898
-[director] Looking sharp today.

455
00:50:26,440 --> 00:50:28,359
[Junho] You're looking
pretty sharp yourself, sir.

456
00:50:28,442 --> 00:50:29,985
[director] Oh, come on.

457
00:50:30,069 --> 00:50:31,779
Wow, this center is huge.

458
00:50:31,862 --> 00:50:32,863
Dr. Min.

459
00:50:34,031 --> 00:50:35,032
-Yes.
-[director] Yeah.

460
00:50:35,115 --> 00:50:37,201
[nurse] We got a call
from your mother's caregiver.

461
00:50:37,284 --> 00:50:39,537
She said someone came to visit
your mother's house.

462
00:51:10,192 --> 00:51:11,318
What the?

463
00:51:35,134 --> 00:51:36,135
-[nurse] Dr. Min!
-Dr. Min!

464
00:51:36,218 --> 00:51:38,137
-Hey, Dr. Min!
-[nurse] Where are you going?

465
00:51:38,220 --> 00:51:39,305
[guest] Isn't that the director?

466
00:52:08,000 --> 00:52:11,462
[Junho] <i>Don't let that woman leave</i>
<i>with anything.</i>

467
00:52:13,422 --> 00:52:18,093
<i>Under no circumstances are you to let her</i>
<i>leave the house until I get there.</i>

468
00:53:18,487 --> 00:53:19,571
[caregiver] Butler!

469
00:53:19,655 --> 00:53:22,116
-Have you seen that woman from earlier?
-[butler] No, I haven't.

470
00:53:22,199 --> 00:53:23,742
[caregiver] Oh, no.
Please find her, quick!

471
00:53:23,826 --> 00:53:26,161
[butler] Huh? What's going on now?

472
00:54:06,410 --> 00:54:07,828
[caregiver] Have you seen that woman?

473
00:54:07,911 --> 00:54:08,912
[aide] No, I haven't.

474
00:54:08,996 --> 00:54:11,081
[caregiver] My gosh, where did she go?

475
00:55:39,670 --> 00:55:41,046
-Damn it…

476
00:55:43,840 --> 00:55:45,926
Damn it!

477
00:56:04,861 --> 00:56:05,862
Mom…

478
00:56:08,407 --> 00:56:09,616
[Jisun] Damn it.

479
00:56:35,434 --> 00:56:36,435
No!

480
00:57:00,083 --> 00:57:01,335
Damn it!

481
00:57:08,175 --> 00:57:09,885
[Junho] Kang Jisun, get out!

482
00:57:10,886 --> 00:57:13,180
Stop!

483
00:58:13,573 --> 00:58:15,701
USB DRIVE 1

484
00:58:32,926 --> 00:58:36,763
03.19, APRIL 27
04.16, APRIL 27

485
00:58:36,847 --> 00:58:37,848
H001.MP4
APRIL 27

486
00:59:44,331 --> 00:59:46,208
-Oh, sorry.
-Hello.

487
00:59:46,291 --> 00:59:50,545
[captain] Well, I'm off duty, and gosh,
what's with all this rain…

488
00:59:50,629 --> 00:59:52,839
I called Detective Lee,
but she's not answering.

489
00:59:52,923 --> 00:59:54,591
I've found such important evidence.

490
00:59:54,674 --> 00:59:56,009
[captain] Oh, the videos…

491
00:59:57,636 --> 00:59:58,804
Yes, I heard.

492
01:00:05,185 --> 01:00:07,103
I couldn't bring myself
to watch them, but…

493
01:00:08,438 --> 01:00:09,898
there are recordings of me,

494
01:00:09,981 --> 01:00:11,149
Detective Lee…

495
01:00:11,983 --> 01:00:13,485
At least six people in total.

496
01:00:14,402 --> 01:00:15,570
Nine.

497
01:00:17,739 --> 01:00:20,325
According to the tech team,
there are nine victims.

498
01:00:24,454 --> 01:00:28,291
And they've confirmed beyond any doubt
that it's Min Junho.

499
01:00:29,334 --> 01:00:32,254
Ms. Kang, this time,

500
01:00:32,879 --> 01:00:34,714
Min Junho is definitely going to prison.

501
01:00:36,341 --> 01:00:37,592
For a very long time.

502
01:00:46,101 --> 01:00:47,602
That's what you said last time too.

503
01:00:48,603 --> 01:00:50,105
The evidence is overwhelming.

504
01:00:50,814 --> 01:00:53,733
Our team is heading out
to arrest him right now.

505
01:01:10,083 --> 01:01:11,167
So it's…

506
01:01:12,919 --> 01:01:14,170
really over now.

507
01:01:15,213 --> 01:01:16,298
[captain] Yes.

508
01:02:47,681 --> 01:02:51,977
[news anchor on TV] <i>Min Junho, suspected</i>
<i>of drugging and sexually assaulting</i>

509
01:02:52,060 --> 01:02:53,687
<i>at least nine people,</i>

510
01:02:53,770 --> 01:02:55,855
<i>has been missing since yesterday.</i>

511
01:02:56,398 --> 01:02:58,900
<i>Min was already</i>
<i>under investigation in connection</i>

512
01:02:58,984 --> 01:03:01,695
<i>with two sexual assault cases.</i>

513
01:03:02,320 --> 01:03:05,281
<i>Police stepped up their investigation</i>

514
01:03:05,365 --> 01:03:08,785
<i>after confirming that he had also</i>
<i>sexually assaulted the case detective.</i>

515
01:03:08,868 --> 01:03:12,122
<i>However, due to insufficient evidence</i>
<i>and because he was not considered</i>

516
01:03:12,205 --> 01:03:16,042
<i>a flight risk, he was allowed</i>
<i>to remain free while under investigation.</i>

517
01:03:16,126 --> 01:03:19,713
<i>And he has disappeared</i>
<i>after leaving his home last night.</i>

518
01:03:19,796 --> 01:03:22,632
<i>But yesterday evening,</i>
<i>police obtained illegally recorded footage</i>

519
01:03:22,716 --> 01:03:26,553
<i>showing at least seven additional victims</i>
<i>of sexual assault,</i>

520
01:03:26,636 --> 01:03:31,433
<i>on top of the two cases</i>
<i>already under investigation.</i>

521
01:03:31,516 --> 01:03:36,146
<i>Police have now issued</i>
<i>a public wanted notice for Min Junho,</i>

522
01:03:36,229 --> 01:03:39,399
<i>who is suspected of nine sexual assaults,</i>
<i>and are tracking his movements.</i>

523
01:03:40,025 --> 01:03:44,195
<i>Police say he is 183 cm tall</i>
<i>and weighs 73 kg…</i>

524
01:04:38,583 --> 01:04:42,504
THE PERFECT LIE

525
01:04:43,004 --> 01:04:45,381
SPECIAL THANKS TO JO HYE-JOO

526
01:05:11,991 --> 01:05:13,201
[Namu] <i>Min Junho…</i>

527
01:05:14,494 --> 01:05:16,788
-[camera shutter clicks]
-I thought he took his own life.

528
01:05:17,497 --> 01:05:19,040
[person 1]<i> It isn't over until it's over.</i>

529
01:05:19,999 --> 01:05:22,377
[Jisun] <i>There were plenty of people</i>
<i>who wanted Min Junho dead.</i>

530
01:05:22,460 --> 01:05:24,087
[person 1] <i>While on the run</i>
<i>from the police…</i>

531
01:05:24,170 --> 01:05:25,171
[Jieun exhales sharply] <i>No way.</i>

532
01:05:25,255 --> 01:05:27,006
You know nothing, okay?

533
01:05:27,090 --> 01:05:29,050
You know what he did, don't you?

534
01:05:29,134 --> 01:05:30,135
Does that matter?

535
01:05:30,218 --> 01:05:32,137
[person 2]<i> Didn't you let him</i>
<i>get away on purpose?</i>

536
01:05:34,097 --> 01:05:37,016
[person 3] Who killed Min Junho?

537
01:05:37,100 --> 01:05:39,144
[Jisun] <i>The one who drove him</i>
<i>to his death…</i>

538
01:05:39,727 --> 01:05:41,229
was Min Junho himself.

539
01:05:58,454 --> 01:05:59,789
THE PERFECT LIE

540
01:05:59,873 --> 01:06:01,875
Translated by Liya Hyunjoo Choi
